      "summary": "The U.S. Senate is poised for an August-September legislative push culminating in a critical September 15 procedural vote on the Digital Asset Market CLARITY Act (H.R. 3633). This bipartisan bill aims to draw distinct boundaries between SEC and CFTC oversight while legalizing smart-contract infrastructure.",
